# build context for all service Dockerfiles is this directory
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
gateway/node_modules
gateway/dist

# Test code and fixtures do not belong in a production image (and `uv sync
# --no-dev` only removes the dependencies, not these files).
**/tests
**/evals

# Runtime droppings from a local run — a stale cache baked into an image would be
# served to every replica as if it were fresh.
**/.geocode_cache.json
**/logs

# Deliberately NOT excluding **/*.md: `uv sync --no-editable` builds the
# laiive-shared wheel inside the image, and hatchling reads the `readme =
# "README.md"` its metadata points at. Excluding markdown fails the build.
